# The Tide Engine's coolant sump with a work suit (CIPlay the_tide_engine_acidsuit, 11-12 w07; in a test world 'CI ...').
# The suit box at the rim (tesumpsuits, 35.6 -35.2) gives 180 s of suit; into the sump to the keepers' locker and
# back out, unhurt, with the coolant still there.
island The Tide Engine keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm
at 36.6 -34.4 h=5.5
use tesumpsuits
expect shown tesump
walk 36.6 -34.4 to 33 -32 to 30.8 -30.8
wait 6
expect unhurt
open Keepers' locker
wait 2
expect item TitaniumIngot 1
picture te_sump_in 34 6 -34 30 4 -30
walk 30.8 -30.8 to 33 -32 to 37 -35
expect unhurt
